{"root":"tinggal","ipa":"/tiŋɡal/","core":"1. 居住，停留；2. 剩下，余下；3. 遗留，留下。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tiŋɡal/","zh":"居住，停留；剩下","phrases":[{"t":"tinggal di Jakarta","zh":"住在雅加达"},{"t":"tinggal sedikit","zh":"剩下一点点"},{"t":"tinggal kenangan","zh":"只剩下回忆"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia tinggal bersama orang tuanya.","zh":"他和他的父母住在一起。"},{"t":"Uang saya tinggal sepuluh ribu rupiah.","zh":"我的钱只剩下了一万印尼盾。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tinggal","ipa":"/tiŋɡal/","zh":"居住，剩下","phrase":{"t":"tinggal kelas","zh":"留级"},"example":{"t":"Dia harus tinggal kelas karena nilainya kurang.","zh":"因为成绩不足，他必须留级。"}},{"w":"meninggal","ipa":"/məniŋɡal/","zh":"去世，死亡","phrase":{"t":"meninggal dunia","zh":"与世长辞"},"example":{"t":"Kakeknya telah meninggal dunia kemarin.","zh":"他的祖父昨天去世了。"}},{"w":"meninggalkan","ipa":"/məniŋɡalkan/","zh":"离开，遗弃，留下","phrase":{"t":"meninggalkan pesan","zh":"留下口信"},"example":{"t":"Dia meninggalkan rumah pagi-pagi sekali.","zh":"他一大早就离开了家。"}},{"w":"ketinggalan","ipa":"/kətiŋɡalan/","zh":"被落下，遗忘，落后","phrase":{"t":"ketinggalan kereta","zh":"没赶上火车"},"example":{"t":"Saya ketinggalan dompet di dalam taksi.","zh":"我的钱包落在出租车里了。"}},{"w":"tinggalan","ipa":"/tiŋɡalan/","zh":"遗留物，遗产","phrase":{"t":"barang tinggalan","zh":"遗物"},"example":{"t":"Ini adalah rumah tinggalan kakeknya.","zh":"这是他祖父留下的房子。"}}],"derSlugs":["tinggal","meninggal","meninggalkan","ketinggalan","tinggalan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:17:49.882Z","src":"base"}